# Operational Runbooks

This directory contains operational runbooks for managing, deploying, and troubleshooting the DistribAI system.

## Runbook Categories

### Deployment Runbooks
- `deployment.md` - Production deployment procedures
- `migration.md` - Data migration procedures
- `upgrade.md` - System upgrade procedures

### Monitoring Runbooks
- `monitoring.md` - System monitoring and alerting
- `health-checks.md` - Health check procedures
- `performance.md` - Performance tuning

### Troubleshooting Runbooks
- `troubleshooting.md` - Common issues and solutions
- `incident-response.md` - Incident response procedures
- `recovery.md` - Disaster recovery procedures

### Security Runbooks
- `security-audit.md` - Security audit procedures
- `incident-response.md` - Security incident response
- `compliance.md` - Compliance checks

## Runbook Template

```markdown
# [Runbook Title]

## Purpose
Brief description of what this runbook covers

## Prerequisites
Required permissions, tools, or access

## Procedure
Step-by-step instructions

## Verification
How to verify the procedure was successful

## Troubleshooting
Common issues and solutions

## References
Related documentation and runbooks
```